      "text_unit_id": "tu_0003",
      "verbatim_text": "7. In asymptomatic patients with long QT syndrome and a resting QTc greater than 500 ms while receiving a beta blocker, intensification of therapy with medications (guided by consideration of the particular long QT syndrome type), left cardiac sympathetic denervation or an ICD may be considered (S7.9.1.1-2,S7.9.1.1-8,S7.9.1.1-11,S7.9.1.1-30)."
